    "title": "A \"new\" face in the junior high - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Felicity P. ,\n1 days ago\nShe’s in the seventh grade wing. This is her first year working in Galway but not her time here! We all got to meet her by writing to ourselves. She sat at the same desks and had some of the same teachers as we do. Have you guessed who yet? Ms. Watrobski–that’s who.\nRead full article",
